SUMMARY:Tomato Jam 2026
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to The Tomato Jam!\nJoin us at The Mule in Asheville\, North Carolina for a celebration of Western North Carolina’s favorite summer crop—the tomato. \nThe Tomato Jam brings together farmers\, growers\, chefs\, makers\, musicians\, gardeners\, and food lovers for a day of local food\, live music\, community\, and Appalachian culture. \nFrom heirloom tomatoes and farm-fresh produce to tomato-inspired dishes\, handcrafted goods\, and great music\, The Tomato Jam celebrates everything that makes Western North Carolina special. \nWe’re looking for tomato growers\, chefs\, restaurants\, makers\, artisans\, nonprofits\, and businesses that share a passion for local food\, agriculture\, and community. \nWhether you grow them\, cook them\, preserve them\, paint them\, or simply love them\, we’d love to have you join us. \nAdmission is FREE. \nVendor participation is FREE. \nVendors keep 100% of their sales. \nWe proudly support ASAP Connections and encourage vendors and attendees to learn more about their mission supporting local farms\, food systems\, and community resilience throughout Western North Carolina. \nCome celebrate the mighty tomato and jam out to some great music with us at The Mule. \n Vendor Application
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/tomato-jam-2026/
CATEGORIES:Free & Fun!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/The-Tomato-Jam-2026-Flyer-V1.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=0be50272c89c11600ee9de8ede09c290
END:VEVENT
