SUMMARY:The Squeeze Box Comedy Jam
DESCRIPTION:Come One\, Come All\, Come Witness if Live Music and Standup Comedy Had a Baby!\nSqueeze Box Comedy Jam spotlights local and regional comedians while an instrumental space funk band known as Quasi Quasar supplies the good vibes! \nBrace yourself for an out of this world experience as dozens of comedians take the stage. \nSqueeze Box offers opportunities for anyone interested in performing standup comedy to enter their name for a bucket pull. If your name is puled from the bucket then you get to come on stage and do a 3 minute set! \n$15 Online & $20 at The Door \n Get Your Tickets Now!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/the-squeeze-box-comedy-jam/
CATEGORIES:Comedy
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/B2DDEEAD-EFE8-4D26-9575-D59B34C35C27.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=80967de420f015b4f7fc5fe8796ceb5c
END:VEVENT
