SUMMARY:Brunchapalooza! Country Crunchy Brunchy
DESCRIPTION:With Nordmoe & The Rodeo\nHonk Tonk. Free Cereal Bar. \nSupporting Southern Appalachian Highlands Conservancy \n  \nBrunch. But Better.\nSundays are for brunch. And Brunchapalooza takes it to the next level with live entertainment\, rotating themes and cuisines and your last chance to do it big before Monday. Each month we’ll be throwing on different costumes\, serving up fresh bevs\, supporting a different non-profit\, and devouring the rotating menu at the Let’s Cook food truck! And that’s not all\, if you know us you know we’ve got more in store\, but you’ll just have to come see for yourself. \nSo get hungry\, stay tuned\, and we’ll see you on Sunday. \n 
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/brunchapalooza-country-crunchy-brunchy/
CATEGORIES:Free & Fun!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/IG-BRUNCH-SEPTEMBER-1-1.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=81cb888e3160a6033b3c31486eb1984d
END:VEVENT
